## aiwatcher-mcp

AI news ingestion, distillation, and alert system — FastMCP 3.2 fleet server.

**Before starting work:**
1. Check recent activity: adn_nav(operation="recent", timeframe="7d")
2. Review current AI news landscape via poll_feeds() or get_top_items()

**At end of work:**
- Document any new feed sources added
- Note configuration changes in AGENTS.md
